  |=  Colour  |= Category |
  |<#E6F4EA>   | AST node classes (_Expression subtypes) |
  |<#FBEBD0>   | Concrete value carriers (_Value) |
  |<#E1ECFB>   | Algorithm / utility modules |
  |<#ECECEC>   | Ancillary: enums, config, data helpers |
  |<#FFFBE6>   | Traits / interfaces |
endlegend

